flowchart TD
    A[Source Code Files] --> B[Treesitter Chunker]
    B --> C[AST-aware Chunks<br/>functions / classes / methods]
    C --> D{Embedding Provider}
    D -->|Ollama| E1[Ollama API]
    D -->|Transformers| E2[HuggingFace Transformers]
    E1 --> F[N-dim Vectors<br/>dimensions per model]
    E2 --> F
    F --> G[Embeddings JSON<br/>Disk Cache]

    G --> H[VectorStore.ingest]
    H --> I[ChromaDB Collection<br/>Vectors + Metadata]

    J[User Query] --> K[Query Embedding<br/>same provider/model]
    K --> L{Hybrid Search}
    I --> L
    L --> L1[Exact Match<br/>identifiers]
    L --> L2[Semantic Search<br/>vector similarity]
    L --> L3[Keyword Search<br/>token matching]
    L1 --> M[Fusion & Ranking<br/>weighted scores]
    L2 --> M
    L3 --> M
    M --> N[SearchResult<br/>ranked + grouped by file]
    N --> O[User Selects Context]
    O --> P[LLM via OllamaClient]
    P --> Q[Generated Response]

    style A fill:#cff,color:#333
    style J fill:#fcf,color:#333
    style Q fill:#cfc,color:#333
    style M fill:#ffd,color:#333
